  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Productive Process of Women Miners in Oruro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oruro women in mining communities have limited income and face safety-related challenges in their way of life. Centro de Investigacin y Servicio Popular (CISEP) provides technical assistance and equipment to mining cooperatives to improve their productivity, occupational safety, and environmental standards. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Bolivia. CISEP&apos;s activities strengthen excluded communities so they can improve their living conditions and participate equally in a nation&apos;s political, economic, and social life.</narrative>
  </description>
